# Specialist document finder

Show the model, revision and audience of every technical document, because a manual that matches the appliance name may still be for the wrong model. Say when a document is superseded. A match in a search is not a compatibility claim. Scope, result count, empty states, focus and the no-JavaScript fallback follow the [shared finder behaviour](../finder.html#finder-shared-contract).

## When to use it

Use it for a narrowly scoped library of technical manuals, compatibility records or installation procedures. Show equipment model, document revision and intended audience when they tell results apart.

## Home Assistant boundary

A document that matches an appliance name may be for the wrong model or revision. Never infer compatibility from search relevance, and never hide that a document has been superseded.

